OL,3,ARussell Brand sentenced to
OL,4,A10-and-a-half years in prison for rape
OL,5,Aand sexual assault
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnother victim said "Russell Brand is a
OL,8,Fsexual predator who has no remorse",
OL,9,Fwhile another said she "felt powerless
OL,10,Fin that moment"
OL,12,FThe woman who Brand raped in 2009 told
OL,13,Fthe court she was "living with trauma",
OL,14,Fand feared she had contracted HIV
OL,16,FBrand faced seven charges: three of
OL,17,Frape, three of sexual assault and one
OL,18,Fof attempted indecent assault. He was
OL,19,Ffound not guilty on three counts
